==Battleground==
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cat (Enemy)|HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cat]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**15 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**15 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Easy stage, even [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] can beat it.

